  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5002.13 “Finale” means the ignition of one or more single shot mortars to conclude the display.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8117, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRED: 1-10-05\n\nNew. #8261, eff 1-21-05; ss and moved by #9765-A, eff 8-2-10 (from Saf-C 5002.10); renumbered by #12124 (from Saf-C 5002.12); ss by #12738, eff 4-30-19",
